s, commodities, and asset allocation strategies; and provides customized investment advisory solutions, wealth advisory services, personalized financial planning, and private banking services, as well as invests in corporate equity, credit, real estate, and infrastructure assets. The Platform Solutions segment offers credit cards; and transaction banking and other services, such as deposit-taking, payment solutions, and other cash management services for corporate and institutional clients. The Goldman Sachs Group, Inc. was founded in 1869 and is headquartered in New York, New York.","employees":47500,"website":"https://www.goldmansachs.com","country":"United States","city":"New York","officers":[{"name":"Mr. David M. Solomon","title":"Chairman & CEO"},{"name":"Mr. John E. Waldron","title":"President, COO & Director"},{"name":"Mr. Denis P. Coleman III","title":"Chief Financial Officer"}]},"sector_medians":{"fpe":12.4,"tpe":14.19,"ps":3.238,"pfcf":18.03,"peg":1.3,"pb":2.369,"rev_growth":0.1,"eps_growth":0.143,"eps_growth_fwd":0.1492,"eps_growth_next":0.102,"div_yield":0.0175,"roe":0.1489,"roa":0.02489,"de":57.54,"gross_margin":0.3787,"op_margin":0.3126,"profit_margin":0.2299,"current_ratio":1.053},"valuation":[{"k":"fpe","label":"Forward P/E","v":11.82,"sector":12.4,"verdict":"Fairly valued"},{"k":"tpe","label":"TTM P/E","v":12.59,"sector":14.19,"verdict":"Fairly valued"},{"k":"ps","label":"Price / Sales","v":3.589,"sector":3.238,"verdict":"Fairly valued"},{"k":"pfcf","label":"Price / FCF","v":null,"sector":18.03,"verdict":"—"},{"k":"peg","label":"PEG","v":1.1,"sector":1.3,"verdict":"Fairly valued"},{"k":"pb","label":"Price / Book","v":2.352,"sector":2.369,"verdict":"Fairly valued"},{"k":"de","label":"Debt / Equity (%)","v":671.2,"sector":57.54,"verdict":"High debt"},{"k":"rev_growth","label":"Revenue growth","v":0.233,"sector":0.1,"verdict":"Strong"},{"k":"eps_growth","label":"EPS growth (last qtr, y/y)","v":0.388,"sector":0.143,"verdict":"Strong"},{"k":"eps_growth_